# Admin Studio UX

- Keep cream / paper / ink / mute / line tokens. No new theme or dark mode for Studio.
- Prefer shared primitives from `AdminShell`: `adminBtn`, `adminControl`, `AdminPageHeader`, `AdminPanel`, `AdminEmptyState`, `AdminFilterBar`, `AdminStatCard`, `AdminStickyActions`.
- Do **not** add numbered how-to step lists on page headers. Clarity comes from labels, grouping, and CTAs.
- Use bordered `adminControl` inputs/selects/textareas — not underline-only fields.
- Primary actions use `adminBtn.primary` (sentence case). Long forms get `AdminStickyActions`.
- Page titles stay compact (`font-semibold`), not storefront display type.
- Empty states include one clear next action.
